899
01:40:19,388 --> 01:40:21,960
Along with the mystery of what
happened to Taggert and the boys.

900
01:40:25,690 --> 01:40:28,410
You know what your friend Taggert
said to me right before he died?

901
01:40:30,570 --> 01:40:34,090
He asked me if I wanted
your share of the gold.

902
01:40:36,570 --> 01:40:37,590
He didn't get it.

903
01:40:39,361 --> 01:40:41,261
I don't want your share.

904
01:40:41,841 --> 01:40:43,828
I want my daughter.

905
01:40:46,771 --> 01:40:51,021
So here's the procedure.

906
01:40:54,900 --> 01:40:58,528
Rankin, Anna, Singh,

907
01:40:59,457 --> 01:41:04,501
Olson's family, me and you,

908
01:41:08,260 --> 01:41:11,220
we're gonna split the gold even.

909
01:41:12,580 --> 01:41:14,711
Cause when I leave here, I don't
want to be worried about you.

910
01:41:14,735 --> 01:41:16,504
And I know you don't want to be
worried about me.

911
01:41:18,068 --> 01:41:21,880
So you sign those papers
and you get your gold.

912
01:41:23,240 --> 01:41:27,000
And then I will go get my daughter.

913
01:41:49,730 --> 01:41:51,970
Oh, yeah, one more thing.

914
01:41:53,090 --> 01:41:55,330
Do you have the registration for that 418.

915
01:41:58,130 --> 01:41:59,130
I like that car.

916
01:43:18,320 --> 01:43:19,320
You ready?

917
01:43:20,792 --> 01:43:23,173
I've been over these papers a
hundred times.

918
01:43:23,800 --> 01:43:25,733
Yeah. I'm ready.

919
01:43:43,050 --> 01:43:44,050
Don't worry.

920
